  \resources\SystemSettings_SurfaceHub_BitLocker_ExportRecoveryKey_Error_NoDrive:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Hei tiaki i te kī BitLocker, i te tuatahi me kōkuhu he puku USB ki te pūrere.
  \resources\SystemSettings_SurfaceHub_BitLocker_ExportRecoveryKey_Error_Header:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kāore i taea te kī whakaora BitLocker te tiaki
  \resources\SystemSettings_SurfaceHub_BitLocker_ExportRecoveryKey_Error_Generic:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: I ngana mātou ki te tiaki i te kī whakaora BitLocker, engari i pā mai he hapa (waehere hapa 0x%08X). Me ngana anō.
